														<r3d:remarks>github: https://github.com/textlab
At the Text Laboratory, University of Oslo, we are currently developing a new version of our corpus search and post-processing tool Glossa. Glossa allows a user to search a text corpus, or a set of corpora, for one or more words, phrases or grammatical constructions.</r3d:remarks>
